  "description": "Hex-grid geometry, axial coordinates, topology, pathfinding, rasterization, chromatization, polyhex contours, Voronoi and Perlin-noise partitioning, and Cellular Potts diffusion.",
  "id": "Akeldov.Math.Hexes",
  "isPrerelease": false,
